WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:05.090
A long, long time ago.

00:05.300 --> 00:08.170
A story from about a hundred years ago.

00:08.970 --> 00:13.430
Nadja, guided by destiny, arrived in Italy

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
NAAJA

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
Nadja,

00:18.890 --> 00:21.440
With your eyes

00:18.890 --> 00:21.440
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
Nadja,

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
NAAJA

00:22.690 --> 00:24.940
What do you see?

00:22.690 --> 00:24.940
Nani ga mieru

00:24.980 --> 00:27.860
Shining in the far distance,

00:24.980 --> 00:27.860
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:27.860 --> 00:30.240
The door to the future,

00:27.860 --> 00:30.240
Mirai no tobira

00:31.160 --> 00:34.620
That's what I'm searching for

00:31.160 --> 00:34.620
Sagashite iru

00:34.620 --> 00:41.830
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:42.540 --> 00:46.040
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:42.540 --> 00:46.040
Minna egao de aetara

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:49.420 --> 00:52.630
It could be so much more fun

00:49.420 --> 00:52.630
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

00:52.680 --> 00:56.100
The world is wide, but it's still one

00:52.680 --> 00:56.100
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

00:56.470 --> 00:59.770
I can't see the end of the journey

00:56.470 --> 00:59.770
Tabi no owari wa mienai

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
God is the only one who could possibly know

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:07.020 --> 01:09.150
I will go waving

01:07.020 --> 01:09.150
Te wo furinagara

01:09.230 --> 01:15.910
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:09.230 --> 01:15.910
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:15.950 --> 01:18.660
But I won't look back

01:15.950 --> 01:18.660
Ushiro mukanai

01:18.990 --> 01:23.960
Until the day my dream comes true

01:18.990 --> 01:23.960
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:24.250 --> 01:27.670
Nadja, Your smile

01:24.250 --> 01:27.670
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:27.750 --> 01:31.090
Nadja, gives me courage

01:27.750 --> 01:31.090
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:31.130 --> 01:34.050
Under the blue sky,

01:31.130 --> 01:34.050
Aoi sora no shita de

01:34.180 --> 01:37.010
I will find the place

01:34.180 --> 01:37.010
Ashita no yukue

01:37.300 --> 01:41.230
where my future lies

01:37.300 --> 01:41.230
Mitsukeru kara

02:17.990 --> 02:21.120
﻿Hey, little girl. It's boring if you do it like that.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.160
﻿How about we try it with some fire this time?

02:30.290 --> 02:31.960
﻿I'll light it up for you.

02:36.970 --> 02:40.930
﻿Sir, I'm afraid I can't allow you to be drunk like that here!

02:41.140 --> 02:42.930
﻿Let me send you back on your way!

03:01.010 --> 03:05.720
Help me! The Memories of Fire

03:07.830 --> 03:12.340
﻿Nadja, get some hot espresso for the drunk men to drink.

03:12.630 --> 03:13.340
﻿Okay!

03:25.140 --> 03:26.140
﻿Nadja...

03:27.520 --> 03:29.270
﻿I-I feel sick...

03:30.650 --> 03:32.270
﻿Bring me some water, would you?

03:32.690 --> 03:34.480
﻿A-And... go get a bucket...

03:35.150 --> 03:36.940
﻿All right I'll go get it for you.

03:38.030 --> 03:41.870
﻿Rita, sorry to ask, but could you watch over the stove's flame so it doesn't go out?

04:26.910 --> 04:30.000
﻿Rita, what's wrong? You've gone all pale!

04:36.800 --> 04:37.590
﻿Rita...

04:41.380 --> 04:42.930
﻿W-Water...

04:43.320 --> 04:43.910
Here.

04:46.180 --> 04:46.890
﻿Thanks...

04:47.640 --> 04:50.230
﻿Nadja, is the espresso still not ready?

04:50.850 --> 04:52.560
﻿Sylvie, sorry, I had something else to do!

04:57.020 --> 04:59.440
﻿That Rita, and I told her to stay here and  watch it!

04:59.650 --> 05:00.150
﻿Geez...

05:05.240 --> 05:07.370
﻿Nadja, what were you doing?

05:07.370 --> 05:08.410
﻿I'm sorry!

05:08.490 --> 05:09.870
﻿It's just that, Sylvie was...

05:09.870 --> 05:11.160
﻿Hurry up and bring it...

05:11.160 --> 05:12.660
﻿...over to the ones who need to drink it.

05:12.670 --> 05:13.710
﻿Okay!

05:16.090 --> 05:17.420
﻿Here, here. Drink.

05:17.670 --> 05:21.300
﻿My goodness, and now we'll be stuck cleaning this up for the rest of the day too.

05:21.300 --> 05:23.970
﻿Don't speak so loudly near me... my ears are ringing enough already...

05:24.340 --> 05:27.010
﻿Because the performances in Italy were over...

05:27.010 --> 05:28.720
﻿...you let loose and drank too much.

05:29.140 --> 05:31.520
﻿Geez, this is so troublesome!

05:33.390 --> 05:35.480
﻿Ah, Nadja... give me some more, please.

05:35.900 --> 05:37.940
﻿Yes, yes. Now you're all better, right?

05:37.940 --> 05:38.900
﻿M-Me too.

05:38.900 --> 05:39.300
Sure!

05:46.200 --> 05:47.780
﻿Rita, where were you?

05:48.580 --> 05:50.240
﻿The stove's fire ended up going out...

05:52.750 --> 05:53.230
﻿Rita!

05:53.230 --> 05:54.100
Nadja!

05:56.580 --> 05:57.630
﻿Kennosuke?

05:58.000 --> 05:59.340
﻿I don't know what's going on with her, but...

05:59.710 --> 06:01.210
﻿She was trembling.

06:01.840 --> 06:02.760
﻿Trembling?

06:05.930 --> 06:07.720
﻿Nadja, what are you doing?

06:07.720 --> 06:09.220
Yes?

06:12.060 --> 06:13.020
﻿Nadja.

06:13.230 --> 06:14.850
I ﻿forgot my wallet.

06:14.980 --> 06:16.850
﻿Can you bring it? It's inside the bag.

06:16.980 --> 06:17.900
﻿Okay!

06:19.730 --> 06:23.320
﻿Also, bring out another shopping basket, if you could!

06:23.860 --> 06:25.360
﻿Okay, okay, okay!

06:25.990 --> 06:27.570
﻿Ah, I'm so busy...

06:27.780 --> 06:29.240
﻿What's with it today?

06:29.580 --> 06:30.870
﻿The wallet...

06:31.120 --> 06:33.700
Umm... was the shopping basket in the salon?

06:39.790 --> 06:41.590
﻿Here you go! The wallet and the shopping basket!

06:41.920 --> 06:43.550
﻿Thanks, Nadja.

06:44.420 --> 06:48.260
﻿By the time we get back from shopping, could you finish cleaning things up for us?

06:49.760 --> 06:50.430
﻿Roger that!

06:50.760 --> 06:51.970
﻿We're off then!

07:07.780 --> 07:10.030
﻿Mama, thanks for the brooch!

07:12.740 --> 07:15.500
I'm ﻿very glad you like it.

07:15.500 --> 07:17.580
﻿I'll be sure to take good care of it!

07:17.710 --> 07:18.580
﻿Yes.

07:57.200 --> 07:59.120
﻿Rita, aren't they cute?

08:00.210 --> 08:02.710
﻿We have to pick some names for them.

08:02.920 --> 08:05.300
﻿Rita, do you know any good names?

08:08.510 --> 08:10.720
﻿I know! Cream and Chocolat!

08:10.720 --> 08:13.600
﻿Hey, hey. Aren't those your favorite foods?

08:15.600 --> 08:17.470
Cream and Chocolat, huh?

08:17.980 --> 08:19.520
﻿Sounds cute. How about it, dear?

08:19.850 --> 08:22.600
﻿But, which one is going to be Chocolat?

08:23.610 --> 08:25.480
﻿That is true, both of them ARE completely white...

08:25.940 --> 08:26.940
﻿Chocolat?

08:28.030 --> 08:29.110
﻿Chocolat!

08:32.620 --> 08:35.160
﻿This one is Cream, and that one is Chocolat!

08:35.330 --> 08:36.330
﻿Right? Right?

08:37.750 --> 08:38.620
﻿Chocolat.

08:39.080 --> 08:40.370
﻿Chocolat.

09:03.560 --> 09:05.980
﻿Mama, thanks for the brooch!

09:06.480 --> 09:08.980
﻿I'm very glad you like it.

09:09.230 --> 09:11.110
﻿I'll be sure to take good care of it!

09:11.490 --> 09:12.240
﻿Yes.

09:28.420 --> 09:29.500
﻿What's the matter over here?

09:29.920 --> 09:31.970
﻿Apparently, Nadja's brooch is missing.

09:32.220 --> 09:34.930
﻿Maybe you dropped it when you were out shopping?

09:35.010 --> 09:37.140
﻿I didn't Have it on when we went shopping!

09:47.400 --> 09:50.070
﻿Kennosuke, do you have an any idea on where it might be?!

09:50.650 --> 09:53.190
﻿Ah, not really, but maybe...

09:54.030 --> 09:55.030
﻿Kennosuke?

10:00.370 --> 10:01.620
﻿Rita!

10:06.880 --> 10:07.880
I ﻿was right after all.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.090
﻿How could you, Rita!

10:11.210 --> 10:13.420
﻿Taking my brooch like that!

10:13.670 --> 10:15.880
﻿Geez... I thought it had been stolen!

10:19.300 --> 10:21.010
﻿Rita, what's the meaning of this?

10:21.270 --> 10:25.100
﻿I'm going to find my mother with that brooch! It's really important to me!

10:25.350 --> 10:26.100
﻿You know that, don't you?

10:28.480 --> 10:29.110
﻿Rita!

10:39.410 --> 10:40.740
﻿Rita! Wait!

10:42.120 --> 10:43.490
﻿Move, Kennosuke!

10:44.250 --> 10:46.960
﻿There's no reason to get so worked up over this.

10:47.460 --> 10:48.370
﻿Kennosuke?

10:48.540 --> 10:50.790
﻿I think that Rita was jealous.

10:51.000 --> 10:52.170
Jealous?

10:52.460 --> 10:54.800
﻿Kennosuke, what are you talking about?

10:55.130 --> 10:57.220
﻿While you guys were out shopping...

10:57.630 --> 11:00.220
﻿In front oft Rita a mother and daughter passed by, talking with another...

11:01.140 --> 11:03.850
﻿And the mother bought a brooch for daughter.

11:04.020 --> 11:05.520
﻿They really looked like they were very happy together.

11:05.730 --> 11:07.440
﻿And Rita saw that...

11:07.770 --> 11:10.520
﻿But to take it, just after seeing something like that...

11:12.270 --> 11:15.690
﻿Rita has been acting a little strange since this morning, you know...

11:16.030 --> 11:17.650
﻿Hm? Really?

11:17.910 --> 11:18.860
﻿No idea...

11:19.570 --> 11:20.950
﻿Yeah... she did seem a little strange...

11:21.950 --> 11:24.410
Even though I asked her to watch over the stove's fire earlier, she...

11:24.870 --> 11:25.620
﻿That Rita..

11:26.960 --> 11:28.790
﻿You had Rita do something like that?!

11:29.120 --> 11:30.290
﻿Eh?

11:31.630 --> 11:33.960
﻿No wonder... it makes sense why Rita would be acting strange.

11:34.050 --> 11:35.760
﻿Rita's afraid of fire.

11:36.800 --> 11:38.470
﻿That's the first I've heard of that!

11:38.760 --> 11:42.050
﻿Rita lost both of her parents in a terrible fire...

11:42.300 --> 11:44.140
﻿And it happened right in front of her...

11:45.560 --> 11:46.600
﻿No way!

12:17.420 --> 12:20.130
﻿Let's see... it was about two years ago, if I remember correctly.

12:21.300 --> 12:24.100
﻿Like we did this year, we had a performance in Rome...

12:24.260 --> 12:25.560
﻿But nearly no guests came at all.

12:26.930 --> 12:28.680
﻿But, we soon found out why.

12:45.160 --> 12:49.910
﻿There was a great circus in town that we could never outperform.

12:50.870 --> 12:51.870
﻿That's where...

13:03.800 --> 13:06.470
﻿Excuse me! Would you please watch over these children?

13:09.270 --> 13:11.270
﻿H-Hey, you guys... Where are you going?

13:11.980 --> 13:15.100
﻿Some of our troupe members and animals are still back there!

13:15.940 --> 13:16.730
﻿Don't go!

13:16.730 --> 13:18.070
﻿Don't worry!

13:18.610 --> 13:20.150
﻿We'll definitely be back!

13:21.700 --> 13:24.910
﻿Mama! Mama!!!

13:26.120 --> 13:27.780
﻿And that's when it happened...

13:44.130 --> 13:48.800
﻿In the end, the circus troupe lost a great deal of its members and animals...

13:49.100 --> 13:50.720
﻿...and ended up disbanding.

13:51.100 --> 13:53.140
﻿And Rita, who lost her parents...

13:53.350 --> 13:56.440
﻿...lost her ability to speak from the shock of it all.

13:57.610 --> 13:59.610
﻿To think she went through something as terrible as that...

14:03.610 --> 14:07.070
﻿I also lost both my parents when I was little.

14:07.370 --> 14:09.410
﻿So, I really understand how Rita's feeling.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.660
﻿Rita was envious of the brooch, but...

14:13.250 --> 14:17.960
﻿In reality, I wonder if she was more envious at the fact that Nadia's mother is still alive.

14:22.610 --> 14:23.530
Nadja...

14:25.050 --> 14:27.930
I ﻿did a terrible thing to Rita...

14:29.810 --> 14:31.220
﻿There's nothing you could've done about it.

14:31.520 --> 14:34.560
﻿That’s because, you had no way of knowing what happened.

14:36.940 --> 14:39.900
﻿I didn't think of anything but myself.

14:40.520 --> 14:43.690
﻿I didn't even try to realize Rita's feelings at all!

14:44.700 --> 14:45.740
Nadja.

14:51.620 --> 14:52.540
﻿Did you find Rita?

14:53.910 --> 14:56.460
﻿I looked in all the places that I thought she would be, but...

14:56.500 --> 14:58.960
﻿Villa Borghese is just too big.

14:59.210 --> 15:00.670
﻿I'm going to go look for her!

15:01.250 --> 15:02.380
﻿All right, everyone!

15:02.550 --> 15:03.630
﻿Let's lend her a hand and look for her too!

15:03.760 --> 15:07.930
﻿It'll be bad if Rita came back find no one was here, so I'll stay.

16:15.540 --> 16:16.450
﻿Did you find her?

16:26.920 --> 16:28.210
﻿Rita!!!

16:28.220 --> 16:29.840
﻿If you're there, say something!

16:31.220 --> 16:33.470
﻿Rita, say something!

16:44.980 --> 16:47.230
﻿Cream! Chocolat!

16:51.780 --> 16:53.780
﻿Rita, where are you?

17:17.720 --> 17:19.810
﻿Geez, there's no helping it, is there?

17:20.020 --> 17:22.230
﻿Even after I told him to close that up for now.

17:30.150 --> 17:33.360
﻿We'll take care of your feeding after we finish our meal.

17:33.490 --> 17:35.160
﻿So just be good until then.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.640
﻿Cream!

18:42.810 --> 18:44.140
﻿Ah! A fire!

18:49.730 --> 18:50.560
﻿Cream!

18:52.690 --> 18:54.900
﻿Is Rita somewhere stuck within that fire?!

19:14.710 --> 19:16.380
There's ﻿someone in there!

19:20.300 --> 19:21.140
﻿Rita!

19:24.350 --> 19:25.350
﻿Rita!

19:27.350 --> 19:28.640
﻿You're going to be all right now!

19:28.810 --> 19:30.150
﻿Hold on tight!

19:30.360 --> 19:31.610
﻿Chocolat! Follow me!

19:36.400 --> 19:37.780
﻿Rita, thank goodness you're all right!

19:37.860 --> 19:39.660
﻿That was way too reckless of you!

19:39.860 --> 19:41.620
﻿But, good job!

19:44.830 --> 19:46.370
﻿What's wrong, Cream?

19:47.000 --> 19:47.750
﻿Where's Chocolat?!

19:48.250 --> 19:50.250
﻿Could it be that... he's still inside the fire?!

19:53.670 --> 19:55.750
﻿It's no use. Give it up, Rita!

20:02.700 --> 20:03.580
Nadja?

20:03.810 --> 20:05.680
I'm ﻿going to go save Chocolat!

20:07.140 --> 20:10.690
﻿I'll be fine. I'll save Chocolat and definitely come back, okay?

20:14.900 --> 20:15.940
﻿Nadja!!!

20:26.290 --> 20:27.910
﻿I-I have to do something!

20:30.670 --> 20:31.920
﻿Looks like it's no good from over here too.

20:48.480 --> 20:50.480
﻿Nadja!!!

20:55.610 --> 20:56.610
﻿There's no other place but here!

21:05.280 --> 21:06.660
﻿We're saved..

21:06.660 --> 21:07.740
﻿Nadja.

21:08.240 --> 21:09.450
﻿Chocolat!

21:10.160 --> 21:13.120
﻿I'm so sorry for getting mad at you earlier, Rita.

21:15.540 --> 21:17.630
﻿R-Rita... did you just talk?

21:19.260 --> 21:20.340
﻿I...

21:20.970 --> 21:21.970
﻿It's true!

21:23.010 --> 21:26.100
﻿Wanting to help Nadja with all her heart, she's regained the ability to talk.

21:26.810 --> 21:29.890
﻿So that voice... was Rita's..

21:31.310 --> 21:33.480
﻿Thank you, Rita!

21:33.810 --> 21:35.560
﻿Nadja!

21:51.410 --> 21:56.380
﻿I'm sure Rita's parents who are living happily in heaven, returned Rita's ability to talk.

21:58.090 --> 22:00.210
﻿All right then, we're off to Spain!

22:00.460 --> 22:01.460
﻿Yeah!

22:15.370 --> 22:18.620
Paris is sunnier than London

22:15.370 --> 22:18.620
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:22.250 --> 22:28.420
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:22.250 --> 22:28.420
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
Indeed

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
Kitto

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
It's not use worrying about it

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:36.380 --> 22:39.510
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:36.380 --> 22:39.510
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:39.770 --> 22:44.480
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:39.770 --> 22:44.480
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
To be, to be

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
Naru naru

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
The tree fog won

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
The world frog-jumping contest

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Under the kitten's paw

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:14.470 --> 23:17.800
Paris is sunnier than London

23:14.470 --> 23:17.800
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
It's not the time to hang around

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Indeed, indeed

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Kitto kitto

23:41.500 --> 23:42.920
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:43.880 --> 23:45.400
What an earth is that!?

23:45.580 --> 23:48.480
The darkness that seemed so far away is getting closer and closer!

23:49.240 --> 23:51.240
Is it resentment from the dead travelers in the ship?

23:51.520 --> 23:53.380
Or a curse from all of the men who died at sea this year?

23:53.560 --> 23:55.280
What will the Dandelion troupe do?

23:56.140 --> 23:59.940
Even if a cold mist suddenly covered the sun's rays,

24:00.240 --> 24:02.420
we can't turn back.

24:03.490 --> 24:04.610
Tomorrow's Nadja.

24:04.610 --> 24:06.530
﻿Great Terror! The Ghost Ship, of the Mediterranean!

24:06.910 --> 24:08.740
﻿Now, the door of destiny opens.
